Package: oceancube
Title: Reproducible Oceanographic Cubes for Marine Ecology and Fisheries
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Elmer",
           family = "Quispe-Salazar",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "elmer@example.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0000-0000-0000"))
Description: Tools to download, read, mask, aggregate, transform, and
    summarize oceanographic NetCDF data as reproducible environmental cubes.
    The package supports marine ecology and fisheries workflows including
    stock-oriented masks, distance-to-coast filters, vertical layers,
    climatologies, anomalies, signal-to-noise diagnostics, and annual indicators.
